### 获取资产列表（直接引用变量）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets/list
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 新增资产
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/add
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetName": "Dell 27-inch Monitor",
  "assetSn": "SN2026-M-001",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 35000.00,
  "location": "Room 501",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-01-07"
}

### 新增资产（error 空 SN）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets/add
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetName": "Dell 27-inch Monitor",
  "assetSn": "",
  "category": "Macbook m1",
  "price": 38000.00,
  "location": "Room 501",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-01-07"
}